# 维护看板工作流：框架入库，运行态数据（工单/证据/审计/日志/本地配置）一律排除
# 运行态目录只保留 .gitkeep，其余任何文件（含非 .md 残留/临时文件）都不入库
.ops/inbox/*
!.ops/inbox/.gitkeep
.ops/tickets/*
!.ops/tickets/.gitkeep
.ops/audit/*
!.ops/audit/.gitkeep
.ops/evidence/*
!.ops/evidence/.gitkeep
.ops/config/*.local.json
.ops/scripts/run/*
!.ops/scripts/run/.gitkeep
